  "rationale": "Raid tuning of 2026-10-08 (branch raid-tuning, merged over main 2464588b, measured at 0fa2af5a). Raids now fight: casting became affordable (cast vigor fp(3) -> fp(0.1875) against every mage's fp(1)), hit points and bolts were brought to one scale (hit-point family /16, direct-damage x4, summon blow /64), the portal shortened to 150 +/- 30 ticks, and the stand-in rival re-armed from 8 max-mastery nodes a raider to 2, and action 14 refused when no raider is named. Every run here is raided by stand-ins, which before this change could not kill anyone (zero casualties across all reference raids) and now kill about three mages an arrival (scripts/standin-lethality-probe.mjs: 0 -> 43 deaths over 14 arrivals on six seeds at 600 ticks). The movement is that behaviour landing on purpose, not a regression.",
